### Notion tag colors (mandatory when writing/editing blocks)

Never overwrite a labeled bullet as one plain `rich_text` span — that strips color. Split tag + body:

| Tag | `annotations` |
|---|---|
| `[EVENT]` | `bold` + `color: "blue"` |
| `[ปริศนา]` | `bold` + `color: "orange"` |
| `[สำคัญ]` | `bold` + `color: "brown"` |
| `[Legacy ต่าง]` / `[Legacy]` | `bold` + `color: "red"` |
| `[เสริม]` | `bold` + `color: "green"` |
| `[Repo check]` | `bold` + `color: "purple"` |

Body text = separate span, `color: "default"`. Preserve existing bold on item names when editing.

